@startuml DS_03_Calcular_Monto_Maximo_Credito
title DS_03: Diagrama de Secuencia - Calculo de Monto Maximo de Credito Aprobado
autonumber
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing true

actor "Vendedor Comercializadora" as User
boundary "Comercializadora App" as ClientApp
control "CreditoResource" as Resource
participant "CreditoService" as Service
database "BanQuito MariaDB" as DB

User -> ClientApp: Solicita cupo de credito para cliente 'CLI01'
ClientApp -> Resource: GET /api/credito/monto-maximo/CLI01
activate Resource

Resource -> Service: calcularMontoMaximo("CLI01")
activate Service

Service -> DB: SELECT AVG(MONTO) FROM MOVIMIENTO WHERE ... TIPO='DEP' AND FECHA >= NOW() - INTERVAL 90 DAY
activate DB
DB --> Service: PromedioDepositos = 850.00
deactivate DB

Service -> DB: SELECT AVG(MONTO) FROM MOVIMIENTO WHERE ... TIPO='RET' AND FECHA >= NOW() - INTERVAL 90 DAY
activate DB
DB --> Service: PromedioRetiros = 320.00
deactivate DB

note over Service
  Calculo de Capacidad:
  Diferencia = 850.00 - 320.00 = 530.00
  MontoMaximo = ((530.00) * 0.30) * 6
  MontoMaximo = 159.00 * 6 = $954.00
end note

Service --> Resource: CapacidadPagoDTO { codCliente: "CLI01", promedioDepositos: 850.00, promedioRetiros: 320.00, montoMaximo: 954.00 }
deactivate Service

Resource --> ClientApp: HTTP 200 OK\n{ "codCliente": "CLI01", "montoMaximo": 954.00, ... }
deactivate Resource

ClientApp --> User: Muestra cupo aprobado: $954.00 (Disponible para financiar celulares hasta dicho valor)

@enduml
